00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:42,000
The Mist is a horror, science fiction, thriller film directed by Frank Darabont.

3
00:18:54,000 --> 00:19:00,000
After a violent storm, a dense cloud of mist envelops a small Maine town, trapping David Drayton
and his five-year-old son in a local grocery store with other local residents.

4
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:18,000
They soon discover that the mist conceals deadly horrors that
threaten their lives, and worse, their sanity.

